  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/IMG_3496.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El s&aacute;bado 3 de junio de 2017, en el centro integral de mayores (CIM), fue proclamada Irene Ferrandis Pe&ntilde;a como reina infantil de la Colla de Gegants i Cabuts d&#39;Onda, en acto presentado por Ana Gargallo Porcar, reina de la Fira 2014, que este viernes, 14 de julio, ceder&aacute; el trono de reina del barrio Arrabal del Castillo a Elena Mart&iacute;nez Ferrer.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonapresenireneferrandisreinacabuts/img_3415.jpg\" alt=\"img_3415\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonapresenireneferrandisreinacabuts/img_3417.jpg\" alt=\"img_3417\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonapresenireneferrandisreinacabuts/img_3419.jpg\" alt=\"img_3419\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonapresenireneferrandisreinacabuts/img_3420.jpg\" alt=\"img_3420\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonapresenireneferrandisreinacabuts/img_3421.jpg\" alt=\"img_3421\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonapresenireneferrandisreinacabuts/img_3423.jpg\" alt=\"img_3423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonapresenireneferrandisreinacabuts/img_3425.jpg\" alt=\"img_3425\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonapresenireneferrandisreinacabuts/img_3426.jpg\" alt=\"img_3426\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /